Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?display-capture-check:=20with=20only=20a=20disp?=
 =?UTF-8?q?lay=20capture=20(no=20game/window=20capture),=20the=20checklist?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20asks=20for=20a=20game=20capture;=20for=20teammate=20voice=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?in=20a=20voice=20program=20it=20flags=20missing=20game=20sound?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20when=20desktop=20audio=20is=20muted=20and=20no=20non-voice?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20application=20capture=20exists;=20for=20in-game=20voice=20a?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20filtered=20non-voice=20application=20capture=20is=20taken=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?as=20the=20game's=20sound=20and=20needs=20picture=20sync=20"alw?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ays";=20on=20OBS=2028/29=20(no=20"=E9=87=87=E9=9B=86=E9=9F=B3?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=A2=91"=20option=20on=20game=20capture)=20the=20fix=20text?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20says=20to=20add=20an=20application=20audio=20capture=20inste?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ad?=
